    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horror Adventure : Zombie Edition is a zombie shooter set in a post-apocalyptic world. There has been an outbreak of a mysterious virus killing people and transforming them into zombies. There are a few survivors left. As one of the few people left on this planet, experience what it\u2019s like to live in the city of the undead. Fight the dead, save other people, hunt in the world and find ways to survive. Kill the virus infected people and protect your family..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981\tSingle Player Story: A full fledged narrative campaign to give you a taste of what it\u2019s like in a post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981\tUltimate Horror experience for players throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2981\tWeapons system: Support for more than 10+ unlockable weapons throughout the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get Ready for Extreme Horror Adventure ahead.</p>",
